  <!-- Feature Grid: "Everything Included" (Laravel / Rails Tier Battery Included) -->
  <section class="py-24 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 mb-3">Batteries Included</h2>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">Everything you need to ship. Zero boilerplate.</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Stop assembling 20 disconnected npm packages every time you start a project. BirFramework integrates the entire web application surface into a single, cohesive developer experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-16">
        <!-- Feature 1: ActiveRecord ORM -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
            01
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">ActiveRecord ORM &amp; Migrations</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Fluent schema migrations, model lifecycle hooks, relationships (<code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">hasMany</code>, <code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">belongsTo</code>), and soft deletes across SQLite, PostgreSQL, and MySQL.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2: .bir Template Engine -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
            02
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">.bir Blade Templates</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Laravel Blade syntax (<code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">@if</code>, <code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">@foreach</code>, <code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">&lt;x-layouts.app&gt;</code>) paired with Instant Turbo client navigation. SPA speed without client bundle weight.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3: Background Queues -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
            03
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">Background Queues &amp; Jobs</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Offload long-running tasks effortlessly. Built-in SQLite and Redis queue drivers with retry strategies, delay seconds, and <code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">bir queue:work</code> daemon.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 4: Real-Time WebSockets -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
            04
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">WebSockets &amp; Broadcast</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Zero-dependency native WebSocket server. Broadcast events directly from your server actions to subscribed client channels with <code class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">Broadcast.to().emit()</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 5: Ignition Debug Screen -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
